AB  - This article discusses the critical role of Business Analysis in identifying business needs and aligning them with organizational goals. It emphasizes the importance of clear communication, effective stakeholder management, and how thorough analysis can lead to better decisions and project outcomes. The author provides practical insights for Business Analysts to ensure that the right business need is addressed.
